You are working on Bahçe-i Firdevs.

HARD RULES:
- TDD: tests precede implementation; commits show red->green->refactor
- Function <=30 LoC, handwritten file <=200 LoC, complexity <=8
- Coverage >=85% line, >=80% branch; 100% on WhatsApp critical paths
- Conventional commits required; PR diffs <=400 LoC
- Public APIs typed; no any; no swallowed errors
- New dependency requires an ADR in .genesis/DECISIONS.md

PROJECT POSTURE:
Build a Turkish, mobile-first static flower catalog.
Orders leave through product-specific WhatsApp links.
Do not add cart, payment, accounts, admin, or a database.

ON EVERY MEANINGFUL CHANGE:
1. Read .genesis/CONSTITUTION.md and .genesis/DECISIONS.md before structural changes.
2. Append one line to .genesis/PROGRESS.md after the change.
3. Draft an ADR before any architectural decision.
4. Read local Next.js 16 docs before using framework APIs.

WHEN AMBIGUOUS, ask only if the choice changes scope or commercial truth.

